  "prefLabel": "Pol 103.01 Contacting the Council",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 103.01 Contacting the Council. All requests for information, rules, declaratory judgments or other council action shall be made in accordance with RSA 91-A to the director at the council's headquarters, 17 Institute Drive, Concord, NH 03301-7413.\n\nSource. #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7301, eff 6-8-00; ss by #9222, eff 8-1-08",
